#: includes/Admin/IntegrationLogController.php:215
msgid "The request arrived and is being checked."
msgstr "La petición llegó y se está verificando."

#: includes/Admin/IntegrationLogController.php:216
msgid ""
"The request was refused before anything was processed (bad credentials, "
"malformed data, or over a limit). Nothing in it was applied."
msgstr ""
"La petición fue rechazada antes de procesar nada (credenciales incorrectas, "
"datos mal formados o un límite excedido). No se aplicó nada de su contenido."

#: includes/Admin/IntegrationLogController.php:217
msgid ""
"The request was accepted and is waiting its turn to be processed, in the "
"order it arrived."
msgstr ""
"La petición fue aceptada y espera su turno para procesarse, en el orden en "
"que llegó."

#: includes/Admin/IntegrationLogController.php:218
msgid "The request is being processed right now."
msgstr "La petición se está procesando en este momento."

#: includes/Admin/IntegrationLogController.php:219
msgid "Every item in this batch finished successfully."
msgstr "Todos los ítems de este lote terminaron con éxito."

#: includes/Admin/IntegrationLogController.php:220
msgid ""
"The batch finished, but at least one item failed or partially failed. See "
"the items below for detail."
msgstr ""
"El lote terminó, pero al menos un ítem falló o falló parcialmente. Consulta "
"el detalle de los ítems abajo."

#: includes/Admin/IntegrationLogController.php:221
msgid ""
"Processing this batch stopped unexpectedly. It can be reprocessed once the "
"cause is fixed."
msgstr ""
"El procesamiento de este lote se detuvo de forma inesperada. Puede "
"reprocesarse una vez corregida la causa."

#: includes/Admin/IntegrationLogController.php:222
msgid ""
"The webhook was turned off while this batch was pending. It will resume "
"automatically once it is turned back on."
msgstr ""
"El webhook se desactivó mientras este lote estaba pendiente. Se reanudará "
"automáticamente al reactivarlo."

#: includes/Admin/IntegrationLogController.php:223
msgid ""
"This request reused an idempotency key already used by an earlier, already-"
"processed request; it was not processed again."
msgstr ""
"Esta petición reutilizó una clave de idempotencia ya usada por una petición "
"anterior, ya procesada; no se procesó de nuevo."

