#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:160
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-log.php:65
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:88
msgid "Integration sections"
msgstr "Secciones de integración"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:166
msgid ""
"The webhook lets an outside system -- typically an ERP or another catalogue "
"-- send price lists, products, prices and customers into this store "
"automatically, instead of somebody typing them in by hand. It receives data; "
"it never sends this store's data out on its own. It does nothing at all "
"until it is turned on in Settings, and once it is, it only accepts requests "
"carrying the webhook's own username and password."
msgstr ""
"El webhook permite que un sistema externo -- normalmente un ERP u otro "
"catálogo -- envíe listas de precios, productos, precios y clientes a esta "
"tienda de forma automática, en lugar de teclearlos a mano. Recibe datos; "
"nunca envía por su cuenta los datos de esta tienda hacia afuera. No hace "
"nada hasta que se activa en Configuración, y una vez activo, solo acepta "
"solicitudes que lleven el usuario y la contraseña propios del webhook."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:191
msgid ""
"Everything happens through a single address. What it does depends only on "
"how you call it:"
msgstr ""
"Todo sucede a través de una sola dirección. Lo que hace depende únicamente "
"de cómo se le llame:"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:197
msgid ""
"Tests the connection and the credentials. Send it with no body and it "
"answers whether the webhook is on and who you authenticated as -- the "
"quickest way to check a new integration before sending any real data."
msgstr ""
"Prueba la conexión y las credenciales. Se envía sin cuerpo y responde si el "
"webhook está activo y con qué usuario te autenticaste -- la forma más rápida "
"de comprobar una integración nueva antes de enviar datos reales."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:201
msgid ""
"Sends a batch: one or more changes to lists/products, or one or more changes "
"to customers, in a single request."
msgstr ""
"Envía un lote: uno o varios cambios a listas/productos, o uno o varios "
"cambios a clientes, en una sola solicitud."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:205
msgid ""
"Looks up the result of a batch you sent earlier, by the batch_id a POST "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"Consulta el resultado de un lote enviado antes, usando el batch_id que "
"devolvió un POST."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:211
msgid "This site's webhook address:"
msgstr "Dirección del webhook de este sitio:"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:215
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "Autenticación"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:216
msgid ""
"Every request must carry HTTP Basic authentication with the webhook's own "
"username and password -- not a WordPress user, not an email address, not a "
"role. You create that username and password (and can regenerate the password "
"at any time) in Integration → Settings; the password is only ever shown "
"once, right after it is generated or set, because only its hash is stored "
"afterwards. Regenerating it immediately stops the old one from working, so "
"the external system must be updated with the new one at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Toda solicitud debe llevar autenticación HTTP Basic con el usuario y la "
"contraseña propios del webhook -- no un usuario de WordPress, ni un correo, "
"ni un rol. Ese usuario y esa contraseña se crean (y la contraseña se puede "
"regenerar en cualquier momento) en Integración → Configuración; la "
"contraseña solo se muestra una vez, justo después de generarla o definirla, "
"porque después solo se guarda su hash. Regenerarla deja de inmediato "
"inservible la anterior, así que el sistema externo debe actualizarse con la "
"nueva al mismo tiempo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:218
msgid "HTTPS is required."
msgstr "Se requiere HTTPS."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:219
msgid ""
"A plain HTTP request is refused outright, except on a site explicitly "
"running in a local development environment."
msgstr ""
"Una solicitud por HTTP simple se rechaza de inmediato, salvo en un sitio que "
"corra explícitamente en un entorno de desarrollo local."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:222
msgid "Open Settings to set up the webhook username and password"
msgstr ""
"Abrir Configuración para definir el usuario y la contraseña del webhook"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:230
msgid "A POST always sends a single JSON object with these fields:"
msgstr "Un POST siempre envía un solo objeto JSON con estos campos:"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:236
msgid ""
"Required. Either \"lists\" (for list and product changes) or \"users\" (for "
"customer changes). A batch can never mix the two: sending a customer action "
"inside a \"lists\" batch, or the other way around, gets the whole batch "
"rejected."
msgstr ""
"Obligatorio. \"lists\" (para cambios de listas y productos) o \"users\" "
"(para cambios de clientes). Un lote nunca puede mezclar los dos: enviar una "
"acción de cliente dentro de un lote \"lists\", o al revés, rechaza el lote "
"completo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:240
msgid ""
"Required. A text of up to 100 characters, unique for every send. Sending the "
"exact same key with the exact same body again simply returns the original "
"batch (nothing is processed twice); the same key with a different body is "
"refused. It can also be sent as the Idempotency-Key header instead of inside "
"the body -- the header wins if both are present."
msgstr ""
"Obligatorio. Un texto de hasta 100 caracteres, único para cada envío. "
"Repetir la misma clave con exactamente el mismo cuerpo simplemente devuelve "
"el lote original (nada se procesa dos veces); la misma clave con un cuerpo "
"distinto se rechaza. También puede enviarse en la cabecera Idempotency-Key "
"en lugar de dentro del cuerpo -- si llega en ambos, gana la cabecera."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:244
msgid ""
"Optional. The date/time the external system considers the batch sent. Purely "
"informational: it is kept in the log but never used to decide how the batch "
"is processed."
msgstr ""
"Opcional. La fecha/hora en que el sistema externo considera enviado el lote. "
"Es solo informativo: se guarda en el registro pero nunca se usa para decidir "
"cómo se procesa el lote."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:248
msgid ""
"Required. A list with at least one change to make. Each entry has an action "
"(what to do), an optional but recommended ref (a free label you choose, "
"echoed back in the result so you know which change it refers to without "
"counting positions), and data (the details of that one change)."
msgstr ""
"Obligatorio. Un arreglo con al menos un cambio por hacer. Cada elemento "
"tiene action (qué hacer), ref (opcional pero muy recomendado: una etiqueta "
"libre que tú eliges, y que se devuelve tal cual en el resultado para saber a "
"qué cambio se refiere sin contar posiciones), y data (los detalles de ese "
"cambio)."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:254
msgid "For type \"lists\":"
msgstr "Para el tipo \"lists\":"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:257
msgid ""
"Creates a new list. Fails if a list with that same external code already "
"exists."
msgstr ""
"Crea una lista nueva. Falla si ya existe una lista con ese mismo código "
"externo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:259
msgid ""
"Changes only the fields sent on a list that must already exist. Cannot carry "
"products -- use one of the products.* actions for those."
msgstr ""
"Cambia solo los campos enviados de una lista que ya debe existir. No admite "
"productos -- para eso se usan las acciones products.*."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:261
msgid ""
"Creates the list if it does not exist yet, or updates the fields sent if it "
"does. The safest default when you are not sure whether the list already "
"exists."
msgstr ""
"Crea la lista si todavía no existe, o actualiza los campos enviados si ya "
"existe. La opción más segura cuando no se sabe si la lista ya existe."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:263
msgid ""
"Deletes a list exactly like doing it from the panel. Its customers go back "
"to the store's normal prices."
msgstr ""
"Elimina una lista igual que hacerlo desde el panel. Sus clientes vuelven a "
"los precios normales de la tienda."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:265
msgid ""
"Copies an existing list (its rules, description and offer) under a new "
"external code."
msgstr ""
"Copia una lista existente (sus reglas, descripción y oferta) bajo un código "
"externo nuevo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:267
msgid ""
"Adds a product rule to a list, or replaces it completely if a rule for that "
"same product already exists -- it is never a partial edit, so the whole rule "
"must be sent every time."
msgstr ""
"Agrega una regla de producto a una lista, o la reemplaza por completo si ya "
"existe una regla para ese mismo producto -- nunca es una edición parcial, "
"así que hay que enviar la regla entera cada vez."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:269
msgid "Removes one product rule from a list."
msgstr "Quita una regla de producto de una lista."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:271
msgid ""
"Leaves a list with exactly the products sent, deleting any rule not "
"included. Requires confirm_replace: true, precisely so an incomplete list "
"sent by mistake cannot wipe out the rest silently."
msgstr ""
"Deja una lista exactamente con los productos enviados, eliminando cualquier "
"regla que no venga incluida. Exige confirm_replace: true, precisamente para "
"que una lista incompleta enviada por error no borre el resto en silencio."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:273
msgid "For type \"users\":"
msgstr "Para el tipo \"users\":"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:276
msgid ""
"Creates the customer if none matches yet, or updates the fields sent if one "
"does. Can also assign or remove their price list in the same call."
msgstr ""
"Crea el cliente si todavía no hay ninguno que coincida, o actualiza los "
"campos enviados si ya existe. También puede asignar o quitar su lista de "
"precios en la misma llamada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:278
msgid ""
"Assigns a price list to an existing customer, replacing whichever list they "
"had before (one customer, one list)."
msgstr ""
"Asigna una lista de precios a un cliente existente, reemplazando la que "
"tuviera antes (un cliente, una lista)."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:280
msgid ""
"Removes a customer's price list; they go back to the store's normal prices."
msgstr ""
"Quita la lista de precios de un cliente; vuelve a los precios normales de la "
"tienda."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:291
msgid ""
"pricing_mode: \"fixed\" with a single unit_price, however many units the "
"customer buys, and an optional minimum_quantity."
msgstr ""
"pricing_mode: \"fixed\" con un solo unit_price, sin importar cuántas "
"unidades compre el cliente, y un minimum_quantity opcional."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:294
msgid "Tiered ranges"
msgstr "Rangos por cantidad"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:295
msgid ""
"pricing_mode: \"tiered\" with a ranges list: each one has min_qty, max_qty "
"(or null for \"and above\", only allowed on the last range) and its own "
"unit_price. The ranges must cover every quantity with no gap and no overlap "
"-- exactly the same rule the panel already enforces."
msgstr ""
"pricing_mode: \"tiered\" con un arreglo ranges: cada uno tiene min_qty, "
"max_qty (o null para \"en adelante\", solo permitido en el último rango) y "
"su propio unit_price. Los rangos deben cubrir toda cantidad sin dejar huecos "
"ni solaparse -- exactamente la misma regla que ya exige el panel."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:299
msgid "Where a rule applies (scope)"
msgstr "Dónde aplica una regla (scope)"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:301
msgid "a simple product, identified by its own SKU."
msgstr "un producto simple, identificado por su propio SKU."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:302
msgid ""
"every variation of a variable product, identified by the parent product's "
"SKU."
msgstr ""
"todas las variaciones de un producto variable, identificado por el SKU del "
"producto padre."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:303
msgid ""
"only some variations of a variable product: give the group a rule_code "
"(unique within the list) and list their SKUs in variation_skus."
msgstr ""
"solo algunas variaciones de un producto variable: se le da al grupo un "
"rule_code (único dentro de la lista) y se listan sus SKU en variation_skus."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:306
msgid "A price rule needs the product to exist already."
msgstr "Una regla de precio necesita que el producto ya exista."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:307
msgid ""
"A rule prices a product that is already published in this store; one "
"referring to a SKU that does not exist fails on its own, and every other "
"change in the same batch still goes through. The products themselves can be "
"created from the webhook too, but through a separate kind of send -- see "
"\"Creating and updating products\" -- never from a price rule."
msgstr ""
"Una regla le pone precio a un producto que ya está publicado en esta tienda; "
"una que apunte a un SKU inexistente falla sola, y el resto de los cambios "
"del mismo envío sí se aplican. Los productos también se pueden crear desde "
"el webhook, pero con otro tipo de envío —vea «Crear y actualizar "
"productos»—, nunca desde una regla de precio."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:315
msgid ""
"Everything above prices products that somebody already created in this "
"store. A batch sent with type \"catalog\" does the other half: it creates "
"the products themselves and keeps them up to date from the outside system, "
"so the shop never has to type an article in twice."
msgstr ""
"Todo lo anterior le pone precio a productos que alguien ya creó en esta "
"tienda. Un envío con el tipo «catalog» hace la otra mitad: crea los "
"productos y los mantiene al día desde el sistema externo, para que nadie "
"tenga que digitar dos veces el mismo artículo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:318
msgid "Off by default."
msgstr "Viene apagado."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:319
msgid ""
"This is the only part of the webhook that writes the shop's own catalogue, "
"so it has to be turned on deliberately in Settings → Product catalogue. "
"While it is off, a \"catalog\" batch is still accepted and logged, but every "
"operation in it fails with catalog_disabled and nothing is written."
msgstr ""
"Esta es la única parte del webhook que escribe el catálogo de la tienda, así "
"que hay que activarla a propósito en Ajustes → Productos del catálogo. "
"Mientras esté apagada, un envío «catalog» se recibe y se registra igual, "
"pero cada operación falla con catalog_disabled y no se escribe nada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:322
msgid "The two actions"
msgstr "Las dos acciones"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:325
msgid ""
"Creates the product when its SKU is unknown here, and updates exactly the "
"fields sent when it already exists. The product is looked up by sku first "
"and, only when that SKU is unknown, by external_id -- so renaming a SKU in "
"the outside system updates the same product instead of creating a second one "
"for the same article. Turning a product that already exists from simple into "
"variable (or the other way round) is refused with product_type_mismatch and "
"nothing is written: that change throws away prices, stock and variations, so "
"it has to be made in the shop by hand."
msgstr ""
"Crea el producto cuando su SKU no existe aquí, y actualiza exactamente los "
"campos enviados cuando ya existe. Primero lo busca por sku y, solo si ese "
"SKU es desconocido, por external_id: así, si en el sistema externo le "
"cambian el SKU a un artículo, se actualiza el mismo producto en vez de "
"crearse uno nuevo. Convertir un producto que ya existe de simple a variable "
"(o al revés) se rechaza con product_type_mismatch y no se escribe nada: ese "
"cambio tira precios, existencias y variaciones, así que se hace a mano en la "
"tienda."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:327
msgid ""
"Takes a product out of sale, reversibly. With \"mode\": \"draft\" (the "
"default) it stops being published; with \"mode\": \"outofstock\" it stays "
"published but out of stock. A SKU this store never had is reported as "
"skipped, not as an error -- an outside system that has dropped an article "
"should not have to know whether this shop ever carried it."
msgstr ""
"Saca un producto de la venta, de forma reversible. Con «mode»: «draft» (lo "
"predeterminado) deja de estar publicado; con «mode»: «outofstock» sigue "
"publicado pero agotado. Un SKU que esta tienda nunca tuvo se reporta como "
"omitido, no como error: un sistema externo que dejó de vender un artículo no "
"tiene por qué saber si aquí alguna vez se vendió."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:330
msgid "The golden rule"
msgstr "La regla de oro"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:332
msgid "What you do not send is not touched."
msgstr "Lo que no envía, no se toca."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:333
msgid ""
"Unlike a product rule, a product is never replaced whole: leaving a field "
"out of the batch leaves whatever the shop has in it alone -- a description "
"written by marketing, a retouched photo, a tag added by hand. Sending a "
"field as null does empty it, on purpose; omitting it does not."
msgstr ""
"A diferencia de una regla de producto, el producto nunca se reemplaza "
"completo: dejar un campo fuera del envío conserva lo que la tienda tenga ahí "
"—una descripción escrita por mercadeo, una foto retocada, una etiqueta "
"puesta a mano—. Enviar un campo como null sí lo vacía, a propósito; omitirlo "
"no."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:336
msgid "Nothing is ever deleted."
msgstr "Nunca se borra nada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:337
msgid ""
"There is no action that removes a product: product.discontinue takes it out "
"of sale and can be undone. The single exception is one variation, which "
"disappears only when it is sent with \"delete\": true."
msgstr ""
"No hay ninguna acción que elimine un producto: product.discontinue lo saca "
"de la venta y se puede deshacer. La única excepción es una variación, que "
"desaparece solo si se envía con «delete»: true."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:340
msgid "The fields of a product"
msgstr "Los campos de un producto"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:345
msgid ""
"Required, always. It is the product's identity here, and it is what a B2B "
"price rule later points at."
msgstr ""
"Obligatorio siempre. Es la identidad del producto aquí, y es a lo que "
"después apunta una regla de precio B2B."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:349
msgid ""
"Optional but recommended. The outside system's own id for the article, kept "
"on the product so it can still be found after its SKU changes."
msgstr ""
"Opcional pero recomendado. El identificador del artículo en el sistema "
"externo, guardado en el producto para poder encontrarlo aunque le cambien el "
"SKU."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:353
msgid ""
"simple or variable, nothing else. Defaults to simple when it is left out. Do "
"not confuse it with the batch's own type, which is always \"catalog\"."
msgstr ""
"simple o variable, nada más. Si se omite, se toma simple. No lo confunda con "
"el type del envío, que siempre es «catalog»."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:357
msgid ""
"Required when the product is being created; optional afterwards, and only "
"changes the name when it is sent."
msgstr ""
"Obligatorio al crear el producto; después es opcional, y solo cambia el "
"nombre si se envía."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:361
msgid ""
"publish or draft, for this one product, overriding the default chosen in "
"Settings. Remember a draft is not found by the B2B rules, which only resolve "
"published products."
msgstr ""
"publish o draft, para este producto en concreto, por encima del valor "
"elegido en Ajustes. Recuerde que un borrador no lo encuentran las reglas "
"B2B, que solo resuelven productos publicados."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:365
msgid ""
"The normal price, as a plain number with no currency symbol. Required to "
"create a new simple product; on a variable product the prices live on its "
"variations instead."
msgstr ""
"El precio normal, como número simple y sin símbolo de moneda. Obligatorio "
"para crear un producto simple nuevo; en un producto variable los precios van "
"en sus variaciones."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:369
msgid ""
"The offer price. It can never be higher than regular_price, and sending it "
"as null removes the offer."
msgstr ""
"El precio de oferta. Nunca puede ser mayor que regular_price, y enviarlo "
"como null quita la oferta."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:373
msgid ""
"Optional date the offer starts, as YYYY-MM-DD. Left out, the offer starts "
"straight away."
msgstr ""
"Fecha opcional de inicio de la oferta, como AAAA-MM-DD. Si se omite, la "
"oferta empieza de una vez."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:377
msgid ""
"Optional date the offer ends, as YYYY-MM-DD. Left out, it runs until the "
"sale price is removed."
msgstr ""
"Fecha opcional de fin de la oferta, como AAAA-MM-DD. Si se omite, dura hasta "
"que se quite el precio de oferta."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:381
msgid "The long description shown on the product page."
msgstr "La descripción larga que se muestra en la ficha del producto."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:385
msgid "The short summary shown next to the price."
msgstr "El resumen corto que se muestra junto al precio."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:389
msgid ""
"A list of categories, each one written as its full path from parent to child "
"-- [\"Tools\", \"Hand tools\"] -- so this store ends up with the same tree "
"the outside system has. A single name is also accepted, and means a top-"
"level category."
msgstr ""
"Una lista de categorías, cada una escrita como su ruta completa de padre a "
"hijo —[«Herramientas», «Herramienta manual»]—, para que esta tienda quede "
"con el mismo árbol que tiene el sistema externo. También se acepta un solo "
"nombre, y significa una categoría de primer nivel."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:393
msgid ""
"One brand name. It is written to the brand taxonomy chosen (or detected) in "
"Settings; when this store has no brand taxonomy at all, the brand is skipped "
"and reported, never invented."
msgstr ""
"Un nombre de marca. Se escribe en la taxonomía de marca elegida (o "
"detectada) en Ajustes; si esta tienda no tiene ninguna taxonomía de marca, "
"la marca se omite y se reporta, nunca se inventa."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:397
msgid "A list of tag names, with no hierarchy."
msgstr "Una lista de nombres de etiqueta, sin jerarquía."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:401
msgid ""
"A list of http or https addresses this site can download, in the order they "
"should appear: the first one becomes the main image and the rest the "
"gallery. Each entry can also be an object with src and alt. An address that "
"is already in the media library is not downloaded twice."
msgstr ""
"Una lista de direcciones http o https que este sitio pueda descargar, en el "
"orden en que deben aparecer: la primera queda como imagen principal y las "
"demás como galería. Cada entrada también puede ser un objeto con src y alt. "
"Una dirección que ya esté en la biblioteca de medios no se descarga dos "
"veces."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:405
msgid ""
"true to have WooCommerce count units for this product, false to leave stock "
"alone."
msgstr ""
"true para que WooCommerce lleve el conteo de unidades de este producto, "
"false para no manejar existencias."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:409
msgid ""
"The number of units in stock, only meaningful while manage_stock is true."
msgstr ""
"La cantidad de unidades en existencia; solo tiene sentido mientras "
"manage_stock sea true."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:413
msgid ""
"instock, outofstock or onbackorder, for a product that does not count units."
msgstr ""
"instock, outofstock o onbackorder, para un producto que no lleva conteo de "
"unidades."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:417
msgid "The weight, in whichever unit the store is configured to use."
msgstr "El peso, en la unidad que la tienda tenga configurada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:421
msgid "An object with length, width and height, in the store's own unit."
msgstr "Un objeto con length, width y height, en la unidad de la tienda."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:425
msgid ""
"The product's attributes. Each one has a name, a list of options, visible "
"(whether it is shown on the product page) and variation. An attribute marked "
"\"variation\": true is one of the axes the combinations of a variable "
"product are built from; the rest are plain information."
msgstr ""
"Los atributos del producto. Cada uno lleva name, una lista de options, "
"visible (si se muestra en la ficha) y variation. Un atributo con "
"«variation»: true es uno de los ejes con los que se arman las combinaciones "
"de un producto variable; los demás son solo informativos."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:429
msgid ""
"Only for a variable product. Each variation needs its own sku and the "
"attributes that identify it ({\"Size\": \"M\"}), and accepts its own prices, "
"sale window, stock, weight, dimensions and a single image. Sending "
"\"delete\": true instead removes that one variation -- the only thing in a "
"catalogue batch that deletes anything."
msgstr ""
"Solo para un producto variable. Cada variación necesita su propio sku y los "
"attributes que la identifican ({«Talla»: «M»}), y acepta sus propios "
"precios, vigencia de oferta, existencias, peso, medidas y una imagen. "
"Enviarla con «delete»: true elimina esa variación: es lo único que borra "
"algo en un envío de catálogo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:434
msgid "Limits of a catalogue batch"
msgstr "Límites de un envío de catálogo"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:438
msgid "Products per send"
msgstr "Productos por envío"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:442
msgid "Variations per send (all products combined)"
msgstr "Variaciones por envío (sumando todos los productos)"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:446
msgid "Variations per product"
msgstr "Variaciones por producto"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:450
msgid "Images per product"
msgstr "Imágenes por producto"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:456
msgid ""
"Products are far heavier than price rules -- each one can write categories, "
"meta and downloaded images -- which is why a catalogue send carries fewer "
"operations than a \"lists\" send. Going over the per-send limits refuses the "
"whole batch; going over the per-product ones fails only that product, and "
"every other product in the batch still goes through."
msgstr ""
"Los productos pesan mucho más que las reglas de precio —cada uno puede "
"escribir categorías, metadatos e imágenes descargadas—, y por eso un envío "
"de catálogo lleva menos operaciones que uno de «lists». Pasarse de los "
"límites por envío rechaza el envío completo; pasarse de los límites por "
"producto solo hace fallar ese producto, y los demás del envío sí se aplican."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:458
msgid "A simple product"
msgstr "Un producto simple"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:461
msgid "A variable product, with one variation removed"
msgstr "Un producto variable, con una variación eliminada"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:469
msgid "A \"lists\" batch: one wholesale list with one product"
msgstr "Un lote \"lists\": una lista mayorista con un producto"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:472
msgid "A \"users\" batch: one customer, with a list assigned"
msgstr "Un lote \"users\": un cliente, con una lista asignada"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:480
msgid ""
"A valid POST never applies anything instantly. It answers 202 straight away "
"with a batch_id and a status_url, and the batch is processed afterwards, in "
"the background, in the exact order its operations were listed. Each "
"operation is independent: if one fails, every other operation in the same "
"batch still runs."
msgstr ""
"Un POST válido nunca aplica nada al instante. Responde 202 de inmediato con "
"un batch_id y un status_url, y el lote se procesa después, en segundo plano, "
"en el mismo orden en que se listaron sus operaciones. Cada operación es "
"independiente: si una falla, las demás del mismo lote igual se ejecutan."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:482
msgid "The batch's own status"
msgstr "El estado propio del lote"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:484
msgid "accepted, waiting its turn."
msgstr "aceptado, esperando su turno."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:485
msgid "being worked on right now."
msgstr "en proceso en este momento."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:486
msgid "every operation succeeded."
msgstr "todas las operaciones se aplicaron con éxito."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:487
msgid "finished, but at least one operation failed or partially applied."
msgstr "terminó, pero al menos una operación falló o se aplicó solo en parte."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:488
msgid ""
"processing stopped unexpectedly; it can be reprocessed once the cause is "
"fixed."
msgstr ""
"el procesamiento se detuvo de forma inesperada; se puede reprocesar una vez "
"corregida la causa."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:489
msgid ""
"the webhook was turned off while this batch was pending; it resumes "
"automatically once turned back on."
msgstr ""
"el webhook se apagó mientras este lote estaba pendiente; se reanuda solo en "
"cuanto se vuelve a encender."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:490
msgid ""
"refused before anything was processed (bad credentials, malformed data, or "
"over a limit); nothing in it was applied."
msgstr ""
"se rechazó antes de procesar nada (credenciales incorrectas, datos mal "
"formados, o exceso de algún límite); no se aplicó nada de él."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:491
msgid ""
"reused an idempotency_key already used by an earlier request; it was not "
"processed again."
msgstr ""
"reutilizó un idempotency_key ya usado por una solicitud anterior; no se "
"volvió a procesar."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:494
msgid "Each item's own status"
msgstr "El estado propio de cada elemento"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:496
msgid "applied completely."
msgstr "se aplicó por completo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:497
msgid ""
"part of it applied (for example, a customer was saved but the list it named "
"does not exist)."
msgstr ""
"se aplicó solo en parte (por ejemplo, se guardó el cliente pero la lista que "
"se indicó no existe)."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:498
msgid "it did not apply at all."
msgstr "no se aplicó en absoluto."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:499
msgid ""
"there was nothing to do (for example, removing a rule that was already gone)."
msgstr ""
"no había nada que hacer (por ejemplo, quitar una regla que ya no estaba)."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:507
msgid "A single send has to stay within these fixed limits:"
msgstr "Un solo envío debe mantenerse dentro de estos límites fijos:"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:512
msgid "List/product operations per send"
msgstr "Operaciones de lista/producto por envío"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:516
msgid "Product rules per send (all lists combined)"
msgstr "Reglas de producto por envío (todas las listas juntas)"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:520
msgid "User operations per send"
msgstr "Operaciones de usuario por envío"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:524
msgid "Maximum request body size"
msgstr "Tamaño máximo del cuerpo de la solicitud"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:528
msgid "Requests per minute"
msgstr "Solicitudes por minuto"

#. translators: %s: maximum number of requests allowed per minute.
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:533
#, php-format
msgid "%s (going over this answers 429, see below)"
msgstr "%s (superarlo responde 429, ver abajo)"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:543
msgid ""
"These limits are fixed: they cannot be changed from Settings, and nothing in "
"a request can raise them. A send that goes over any of them is refused "
"whole, and nothing in it is processed."
msgstr ""
"Estos límites son fijos: no se pueden cambiar desde Configuración, y nada en "
"una solicitud puede aumentarlos. Un envío que supere cualquiera de ellos se "
"rechaza por completo, y no se procesa nada de él."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:555
msgid ""
"No credentials were sent, or the username/password is wrong. Check them in "
"Settings; they are case-sensitive."
msgstr ""
"No se enviaron credenciales, o el usuario/contraseña está incorrecto. "
"Revísalos en Configuración; distinguen mayúsculas de minúsculas."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:559
msgid ""
"Either the webhook is turned off in Settings, or the URL is wrong. WordPress "
"answers exactly the same \"route not found\" either way, on purpose."
msgstr ""
"O el webhook está apagado en Configuración, o la URL está mal. WordPress "
"responde exactamente el mismo \"ruta no encontrada\" en ambos casos, a "
"propósito."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:563
msgid ""
"The request body is bigger than the maximum allowed size. Split it into "
"smaller batches."
msgstr ""
"El cuerpo de la solicitud es más grande que el tamaño máximo permitido. "
"Divídelo en lotes más pequeños."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:567
msgid "The Content-Type header was not application/json."
msgstr "La cabecera Content-Type no era application/json."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:572
msgid ""
"The batch is not well-formed; nothing in it was processed. The response "
"lists every problem found. The most common ones:"
msgstr ""
"El lote no está bien formado; no se procesó nada de él. La respuesta lista "
"cada problema encontrado. Los más comunes:"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:574
msgid "type is missing, or is something other than \"lists\"/\"users\"."
msgstr "falta type, o su valor es distinto de \"lists\"/\"users\"."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:575
msgid ""
"an operation does not belong to the declared type (for example, a user.* "
"action inside a \"lists\" batch)."
msgstr ""
"una operación no pertenece al tipo declarado (por ejemplo, una acción user.* "
"dentro de un lote \"lists\")."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:576
msgid "idempotency_key is missing from both the body and the header."
msgstr "falta idempotency_key, tanto en el cuerpo como en la cabecera."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:577
msgid "the batch has more operations than this site's limit allows."
msgstr ""
"el lote tiene más operaciones de las que permite el límite de este sitio."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:583
msgid ""
"The idempotency_key was already used for a batch with different content. Use "
"a new key for a genuinely new send."
msgstr ""
"El idempotency_key ya se usó para un lote con contenido distinto. Usa una "
"clave nueva para un envío realmente nuevo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:587
msgid ""
"Too many requests too quickly. Wait the number of seconds given in the Retry-"
"After header before trying again."
msgstr ""
"Demasiadas solicitudes demasiado rápido. Espera la cantidad de segundos "
"indicada en la cabecera Retry-After antes de volver a intentarlo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:591
msgid ""
"The request could not be recorded, so it was not processed. Try again "
"shortly; nothing was applied."
msgstr ""
"La solicitud no se pudo registrar, así que no se procesó. Vuelve a "
"intentarlo en un momento; no se aplicó nada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:596
msgid ""
"After any of the responses above, the idempotency_key used stays free: fix "
"the request and resend it with the very same key."
msgstr ""
"Después de cualquiera de las respuestas anteriores, el idempotency_key usado "
"queda libre: corrige la solicitud y reenvíala con esa misma clave."

#. translators: 1: opening link tag to the Log tab, 2: closing link tag.
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:607
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Every request the webhook receives is recorded in %1$sIntegration → Log%2$s "
"-- including requests that were rejected outright. The one exception is a "
"failed username/password attempt: that is kept only as a short security "
"line, without the data that was sent, so a stolen or mistyped password is "
"never itself stored."
msgstr ""
"Toda solicitud que recibe el webhook queda registrada en %1$sIntegración → "
"Registro%2$s -- incluidas las que se rechazaron de plano. La única excepción "
"es un intento fallido de usuario/contraseña: eso se guarda solo como una "
"línea breve de seguridad, sin los datos que se enviaron, para que una "
"contraseña robada o mal escrita nunca quede almacenada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:614
msgid ""
"Opening a batch shows: the JSON exactly as it was received and a formatted, "
"highlighted copy of it; the response that was sent back; the result of every "
"item, with its errors when it has any; and a timeline of events. Everything "
"can be downloaded, and a site administrator can also download the whole "
"batch as a single .zip file."
msgstr ""
"Al abrir un lote se ve: el JSON tal como se recibió y una copia formateada y "
"resaltada de este; la respuesta que se envió de vuelta; el resultado de cada "
"elemento, con sus errores cuando los tiene; y una línea de tiempo de "
"eventos. Todo se puede descargar, y un administrador del sitio también puede "
"descargar el lote completo en un solo archivo .zip."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:616
msgid ""
"A batch with failed or partial items can be reprocessed, either item by item "
"or all of them at once, without resending anything from the external system."
msgstr ""
"Un lote con elementos fallidos o parciales se puede reprocesar, ya sea uno "
"por uno o todos a la vez, sin volver a enviar nada desde el sistema externo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:618
msgid ""
"How long this history is kept (6, 12 or 24 months, 12 by default) is chosen "
"in Settings; older requests are removed automatically once a day."
msgstr ""
"Cuánto tiempo se conserva este historial (6, 12 o 24 meses; 12 por defecto) "
"se elige en Configuración; las solicitudes más antiguas se eliminan "
"automáticamente una vez al día."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:621
msgid "\"Debug events\", in Settings:"
msgstr "«Eventos de depuración», en Configuración:"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:622
msgid ""
"a checkbox, on by default, that keeps a detailed, step-by-step note of "
"everything that happened while a batch was processed, not only its final "
"result. It is recommended to leave it on: it is what makes diagnosing a "
"problem from the timeline of a batch possible in the first place."
msgstr ""
"una casilla, activada por defecto, que guarda un registro detallado, paso a "
"paso, de todo lo que pasó mientras se procesaba un lote, no solo su "
"resultado final. Se recomienda dejarla activada: es lo que hace posible "
"diagnosticar un problema a partir de la línea de tiempo de un lote."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:630
msgid ""
"In Settings you can list one or more email addresses (up to 10) to be told "
"automatically when something needs attention, instead of having to keep "
"checking Integration → Log yourself."
msgstr ""
"En Configuración puedes anotar una o varias direcciones de correo (hasta 10) "
"para que se te avise automáticamente cuando algo necesite atención, en lugar "
"de tener que estar revisando Integración → Registro tú mismo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:633
msgid ""
"An email goes out for absolutely every error: any request that is rejected "
"outright -- wrong or missing credentials, the webhook turned off or the "
"wrong URL, too many requests too quickly, a malformed batch, and every other "
"case covered above -- as well as any batch that finishes with errors or "
"fails. Nothing is left out."
msgstr ""
"Se envía un correo por absolutamente todo error: cualquier solicitud que se "
"rechace de plano -- credenciales incorrectas o faltantes, el webhook apagado "
"o la URL equivocada, demasiadas solicitudes demasiado rápido, un lote mal "
"formado, y cualquier otro caso de los explicados arriba -- así como "
"cualquier lote que termine con errores o que falle. No se deja fuera nada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:634
msgid ""
"To avoid flooding the inbox during a spike of errors, up to 30 individual "
"emails are sent within any given hour; anything past that in the same hour "
"is not dropped, it is gathered into a single summary email instead, so "
"nothing goes unnoticed."
msgstr ""
"Para no inundar la bandeja de entrada durante un pico de errores, se envían "
"hasta 30 correos individuales dentro de una misma hora; lo que exceda eso en "
"esa misma hora no se descarta, sino que se agrupa en un solo correo resumen, "
"para que nada pase desapercibido."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:635
msgid ""
"These emails never contain the webhook's password, its credentials, or the "
"full JSON that was sent or received -- only enough to know where to look, "
"such as the batch id, the date and what went wrong."
msgstr ""
"Estos correos nunca contienen la contraseña del webhook, sus credenciales, "
"ni el JSON completo que se envió o se recibió -- solo lo necesario para "
"saber dónde buscar, como el batch id, la fecha y qué salió mal."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:643
msgid "Retail or wholesale: customer_type"
msgstr "Minorista o mayorista: customer_type"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:644
msgid ""
"A user.upsert operation says what kind of account it is with customer_type, "
"and the role follows from that value on its own -- there is nothing else to "
"send:"
msgstr ""
"Una operación user.upsert dice qué tipo de cuenta es con customer_type, y el "
"rol sale solo de ese valor: no hay que enviar nada más."

#. translators: %s: role slug given to a retail customer, wrapped in a <code> tag.
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:651
#, php-format
msgid ""
"a retail account. It is given WooCommerce's own Customer role (%s) and keeps "
"the store's normal prices."
msgstr ""
"una cuenta minorista. Recibe el rol Cliente de WooCommerce (%s) y conserva "
"los precios normales de la tienda."

#. translators: %s: role slug currently given to a B2B customer, wrapped in a <code> tag.
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:661
#, php-format
msgid ""
"a wholesale account. It is given this store's B2B role, %s, which the plugin "
"creates by itself -- there is nothing to configure."
msgstr ""
"una cuenta mayorista. Recibe el rol B2B de esta tienda, %s, que el plugin "
"crea solo: no hay nada que configurar."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:667
msgid ""
"The field is optional: left out, the role of an existing customer is not "
"touched, and a brand-new customer is created as retail. Any value other than "
"\"b2c\" or \"b2b\" is refused with invalid_customer_type, and only that one "
"operation fails -- the rest of the batch still goes through."
msgstr ""
"El campo es opcional: si se omite, no se toca el rol de un cliente que ya "
"existe, y un cliente nuevo se crea como minorista. Cualquier valor distinto "
"de «b2c» o «b2b» se rechaza con invalid_customer_type, y falla solo esa "
"operación: el resto del envío sí se aplica."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:668
msgid ""
"You can still send role yourself instead, and it wins over customer_type, as "
"long as it is one of those two roles; any other role is refused with "
"role_not_allowed."
msgstr ""
"También puede enviar role usted mismo, y manda por encima de customer_type, "
"siempre que sea uno de esos dos roles; cualquier otro se rechaza con "
"role_not_allowed."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:670
msgid "The role only says what kind of account it is."
msgstr "El rol solo dice qué tipo de cuenta es."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:671
msgid ""
"It never decides a single price: the B2B price always comes from the price "
"list assigned to that customer. The B2B role is created with exactly the "
"permissions of a normal customer and nothing more, and it exists so the "
"store can tell its wholesale accounts apart -- to filter them, to greet them "
"differently, to report on them."
msgstr ""
"Nunca decide ningún precio: el precio B2B siempre sale de la lista asignada "
"a ese cliente. El rol B2B se crea con exactamente los mismos permisos que un "
"cliente normal y nada más, y existe para que la tienda pueda distinguir sus "
"cuentas mayoristas: filtrarlas, saludarlas distinto, sacar reportes de ellas."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:674
msgid "A retail customer cannot carry a price list."
msgstr "Un cliente minorista no puede llevar lista de precios."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:675
msgid ""
"Sending \"customer_type\": \"b2c\" together with a list_external_code is "
"refused with list_not_allowed_for_b2c, rather than silently picking one of "
"the two: the list is precisely what makes an account wholesale, so the two "
"contradict each other. Send customer_type \"b2b\", or leave the list out."
msgstr ""
"Enviar «customer_type»: «b2c» junto con un list_external_code se rechaza con "
"list_not_allowed_for_b2c, en vez de elegir uno de los dos en silencio: la "
"lista es justamente lo que hace mayorista a una cuenta, así que se "
"contradicen. Envíe customer_type «b2b», o deje la lista fuera."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:678
msgid "The tax id (NIT)"
msgstr "El NIT"

#. translators: 1: the billing.nit field name, wrapped in a <code> tag, 2: meta key the tax id is currently written to, wrapped in a <code> tag.
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:683
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A customer's tax id travels inside the billing object, as %1$s. It is "
"written to the very field this store already keeps a tax id in -- %2$s right "
"now -- so it shows up on the customer's billing address and on their orders "
"like any other field, never in a field only this plugin knows about. Which "
"field that is, the plugin works out from the store itself: there is nothing "
"to configure, and while no customer or order carries a tax id yet it keeps "
"looking, so the first one that does settles it."
msgstr ""
"El NIT del cliente viaja dentro del objeto billing, como %1$s. Se escribe en "
"el mismo campo donde esta tienda ya guarda el NIT —hoy %2$s—, así que "
"aparece en la dirección de facturación del cliente y en sus pedidos como "
"cualquier otro dato, nunca en un campo que solo conozca este plugin. Cuál es "
"ese campo lo averigua el plugin de la propia tienda: no hay nada que "
"configurar, y mientras ningún cliente ni pedido traiga NIT lo sigue "
"buscando, así que el primero que lo traiga lo deja resuelto."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:689
msgid ""
"Sent as an empty string or null it clears the field; left out of the billing "
"object, it is not touched -- exactly like every other billing and shipping "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Enviado como cadena vacía o null borra el dato; si no viene en el objeto "
"billing, no se toca, igual que cualquier otro campo de facturación y envío."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:691
msgid "And in every case"
msgstr "Y en todos los casos"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:693
msgid ""
"The WooCommerce \"New account\" welcome email is off by default for accounts "
"the webhook creates. A site can turn it on for every new account in "
"Settings, or a single user.upsert operation can ask for it with "
"\"send_welcome_email\": true regardless of that setting."
msgstr ""
"El correo de bienvenida «Nueva cuenta» de WooCommerce está desactivado por "
"defecto para las cuentas que crea el webhook. Un sitio puede activarlo para "
"toda cuenta nueva desde Configuración, o una operación user.upsert puede "
"pedirlo individualmente con \"send_welcome_email\": true sin importar ese "
"ajuste."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:694
msgid ""
"A protected account (an administrator or anyone else with an administrative "
"role) is never modified or matched by the webhook, whatever external code or "
"email is sent."
msgstr ""
"Una cuenta protegida (un administrador o cualquier otra con un rol "
"administrativo) nunca es modificada ni encontrada por el webhook, sin "
"importar qué external_code o correo se envíe."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:695
msgid ""
"A customer is looked up first by external_code and, only if that is not "
"sent, by email."
msgstr ""
"Un cliente se busca primero por external_code y, solo si eso no se envía, "
"por correo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:704
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:164
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:166
msgid "Turn the webhook on"
msgstr "Activar el webhook"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:704
msgid "In Settings, and set (or generate) its username and password."
msgstr "En Configuración, y define (o genera) su usuario y contraseña."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:705
msgid "Give the external system the address and the credentials"
msgstr "Dale al sistema externo la dirección y las credenciales"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:705
msgid ""
"The webhook URL shown above, and the username/password -- never a WordPress "
"account."
msgstr ""
"La URL del webhook que se muestra arriba, y el usuario/contraseña -- nunca "
"una cuenta de WordPress."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:706
msgid "Send a GET request first"
msgstr "Envía primero una solicitud GET"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:706
msgid ""
"With no body, to confirm the connection and the credentials work before "
"sending anything real."
msgstr ""
"Sin cuerpo, para confirmar que la conexión y las credenciales funcionan "
"antes de enviar algo real."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:707
msgid "Confirm every SKU you plan to price already exists"
msgstr "Confirme que cada SKU al que va a ponerle precio ya existe"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:707
msgid ""
"And is published in this store's catalogue. If the products are not here "
"yet, send them first with a catalogue batch, or load them by hand, and only "
"then send their B2B prices."
msgstr ""
"Y que está publicado en el catálogo de esta tienda. Si los productos todavía "
"no están aquí, envíelos primero con un envío de catálogo, o cárguelos a "
"mano, y hasta entonces mande sus precios B2B."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:708
msgid "Send one small batch first"
msgstr "Envía primero un lote pequeño"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:708
msgid ""
"With a real idempotency_key, and check its result in Integration → Log "
"before sending everything."
msgstr ""
"Con un idempotency_key real, y revisa su resultado en Integración → Registro "
"antes de enviarlo todo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:709
msgid "Decide the welcome-email behaviour"
msgstr "Decide el comportamiento del correo de bienvenida"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:709
msgid ""
"Either the general Settings switch, or send_welcome_email on individual "
"customers."
msgstr ""
"Ya sea con el interruptor general de Configuración, o con send_welcome_email "
"en clientes individuales."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:718
msgid "Do I need to create a WordPress user for the external system?"
msgstr "¿Necesito crear un usuario de WordPress para el sistema externo?"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:719
msgid ""
"No. The webhook has its own username and password, unrelated to any "
"WordPress account, email or role."
msgstr ""
"No. El webhook tiene su propio usuario y contraseña, sin relación con "
"ninguna cuenta de WordPress, correo o rol."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:721
msgid "Can one send include both lists and customers?"
msgstr "¿Puede un mismo envío incluir listas y clientes a la vez?"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:722
msgid ""
"No. Every send declares one type, \"lists\" or \"users\", and only actions "
"matching that type are accepted."
msgstr ""
"No. Cada envío declara un solo type, \"lists\" o \"users\", y solo se "
"aceptan las acciones que correspondan a ese tipo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:724
msgid "What happens if I accidentally send the same batch twice?"
msgstr "¿Qué pasa si por error envío el mismo lote dos veces?"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:725
msgid ""
"If the body is identical and the idempotency_key is the same, nothing is "
"processed again: you get back the original batch's own current status. If "
"the body is different, the second send is refused instead of silently "
"overwriting the first."
msgstr ""
"Si el cuerpo es idéntico y el idempotency_key es el mismo, no se procesa "
"nada de nuevo: recibes de vuelta el estado actual del lote original. Si el "
"cuerpo es distinto, el segundo envío se rechaza en lugar de sobrescribir el "
"primero en silencio."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:727
msgid "Can I edit part of a product rule with products.upsert?"
msgstr ""
"¿Puedo editar solo una parte de una regla de producto con products.upsert?"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:728
msgid ""
"No -- it always replaces the whole rule. Send every field the rule should "
"end up with, not only the ones that changed."
msgstr ""
"No -- siempre reemplaza la regla completa. Hay que enviar todos los campos "
"con los que debe quedar la regla, no solo los que cambiaron."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:730
msgid "One product in my batch failed. Does that stop the rest?"
msgstr "Un producto de mi lote falló. ¿Eso detiene el resto?"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:731
msgid ""
"No. Every operation in a batch is independent: the others still run, and the "
"failed one is reported on its own in the batch's result and in the log."
msgstr ""
"No. Cada operación de un lote es independiente: las demás igual se ejecutan, "
"y la que falló se reporta por separado en el resultado del lote y en el "
"registro."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:733
msgid "Why does the same URL sometimes answer 404?"
msgstr "¿Por qué la misma URL a veces responde 404?"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-guide.php:734
msgid ""
"Either the webhook is currently turned off in Settings, or the address was "
"typed incorrectly. Both look identical on purpose, to avoid revealing to an "
"outsider whether the endpoint exists at all."
msgstr ""
"O el webhook está apagado en este momento en Configuración, o la dirección "
"se escribió mal. Ambos casos se ven idénticos a propósito, para no revelarle "
"a alguien externo si el endpoint existe siquiera."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-log-detail.php:50
msgid "One batch, exactly as it arrived and exactly what it did"
msgstr "Un lote, tal como llegó y con todo lo que hizo"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-log-detail.php:54
msgid "Back to the log"
msgstr "Volver al registro"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-log-detail.php:67
msgid ""
"Reprocessing was requested. Results will update once the queue picks it up "
"(usually within a minute)."
msgstr ""
"Se solicitó el reproceso. Los resultados se actualizarán cuando la cola lo "
"tome (normalmente en menos de un minuto)."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-log-detail.php:70
#: includes/Webhook/NotificationEmail.php:173
#: includes/Webhook/NotificationEmail.php:211
msgid "Batch"
msgstr "Lote"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-log-detail.php:96
msgid "total"
msgstr "total"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-log-detail.php:101
msgid "ok"
msgstr "éxito"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-log-detail.php:106
msgid "partial"
msgstr "parcial"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-log-detail.php:111
msgid "error"
