msgstr "Configuración guardada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:55
msgid ""
"The webhook was not enabled: configure a username and a password below first."
msgstr ""
"El webhook no se activó: configure primero un usuario y una contraseña más "
"abajo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:57
msgid "Webhook username saved."
msgstr "Usuario del webhook guardado."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:59
msgid ""
"That username is not valid: use 3 to 60 letters, numbers, dots, underscores "
"or hyphens."
msgstr ""
"Ese usuario no es válido: use de 3 a 60 letras, números, puntos, guiones "
"bajos o guiones."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:61
msgid ""
"New password generated. Copy it below before leaving this page -- it will "
"not be shown again."
msgstr ""
"Se generó una contraseña nueva. Cópiela abajo antes de salir de esta página: "
"no se volverá a mostrar."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:63
msgid "Webhook password updated."
msgstr "Contraseña del webhook actualizada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:65
msgid "That password is too short: use at least 20 characters."
msgstr "Esa contraseña es demasiado corta: use al menos 20 caracteres."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:100
msgid "New password generated:"
msgstr "Contraseña nueva generada:"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:107
msgid "Save it now; it will not be shown again."
msgstr "Guárdela ahora; no se volverá a mostrar."

#. translators: %s: date/time (UTC) the webhook credentials were last configured.
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:116
#, php-format
msgid "Credentials configured on %s UTC."
msgstr "Credenciales configuradas el %s UTC."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:121
msgid ""
"No credentials configured yet. The webhook cannot be enabled until a "
"username and a password are set here."
msgstr ""
"Aún no hay credenciales configuradas. El webhook no se puede activar hasta "
"configurar aquí un usuario y una contraseña."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:128
msgid "Webhook username"
msgstr "Usuario del webhook"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:130
msgid "Save username"
msgstr "Guardar usuario"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:131
msgid "3 to 60 characters: letters, numbers, dots, underscores and hyphens."
msgstr ""
"De 3 a 60 caracteres: letras, números, puntos, guiones bajos y guiones."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:137
msgid "Generate new password"
msgstr "Generar contraseña nueva"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:138
msgid ""
"Creates a random 32-character password and shows it once, above. Any "
"password already in use stops working immediately."
msgstr ""
"Crea una contraseña aleatoria de 32 caracteres y la muestra una sola vez, "
"arriba. Cualquier contraseña en uso deja de funcionar de inmediato."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:144
msgid "Or set a password"
msgstr "O bien, establezca una contraseña"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:146
msgid "Set password"
msgstr "Establecer contraseña"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:147
msgid ""
"At least 20 characters. Only needed if you want to choose your own password "
"instead of generating one."
msgstr ""
"Al menos 20 caracteres. Solo es necesario si prefiere elegir su propia "
"contraseña en vez de generar una."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:155
msgid "Webhook status"
msgstr "Estado del webhook"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:158
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Activado"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:168
msgid ""
"Off by default. While off, none of the endpoints below exist -- any request "
"to them gets a plain 404, exactly like an address that was never registered."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado por defecto. Mientras esté desactivado, ninguno de los endpoints "
"de abajo existe: cualquier petición a ellos recibe un 404 sencillo, igual "
"que una dirección que nunca se registró."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:185
msgid ""
"One address for everything. POST sends a batch: \"type\": \"lists\" for list "
"and product operations, or \"type\": \"users\" for user operations; GET "
"checks the connection; GET with ?batch_id= returns the result of a batch. "
"Authenticate with the webhook username and password configured above, using "
"HTTP Basic authentication over HTTPS -- in the external system's own "
"configuration, or in a tool such as Postman."
msgstr ""
"Una sola dirección para todo. POST envía un lote: \"type\": \"lists\" para "
"operaciones de listas y productos, o \"type\": \"users\" para operaciones de "
"usuarios; GET prueba la conexión; GET con ?batch_id= devuelve el resultado "
"de un lote. Autentícate con el usuario y la contraseña del webhook "
"configurados arriba, con autenticación HTTP Basic sobre HTTPS, en la "
"configuración del sistema externo o en una herramienta como Postman."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:200
msgid "Published (recommended)"
msgstr "Publicado (recomendado)"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:201
msgid ""
"A product the webhook creates goes on sale straight away, and the B2B price "
"lists can resolve it immediately."
msgstr ""
"Un producto creado por el webhook queda a la venta de una vez, y las listas "
"de precios B2B pueden resolverlo de inmediato."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:205
msgid "Draft"
msgstr "Borrador"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:206
msgid ""
"A product the webhook creates waits for somebody in the shop to review and "
"publish it by hand."
msgstr ""
"Un producto creado por el webhook espera a que alguien de la tienda lo "
"revise y lo publique a mano."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:210
msgid "Product catalogue"
msgstr "Productos del catálogo"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:213
msgid "Create and update products"
msgstr "Crear y actualizar productos"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:219
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:221
msgid "Let the webhook create and update this store's products"
msgstr "Permitir que el webhook cree y actualice los productos de esta tienda"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:223
msgid ""
"Off by default. While it is off, the webhook neither creates nor modifies a "
"single product: every operation in a \"catalog\" batch is refused with "
"catalog_disabled, and the rest of the webhook -- price lists, product rules "
"and customers -- keeps working exactly as before."
msgstr ""
"Viene apagado. Mientras lo esté, el webhook no crea ni modifica ningún "
"producto: toda operación de un envío «catalog» se rechaza con "
"catalog_disabled, y el resto del webhook —listas de precios, reglas de "
"producto y clientes— sigue funcionando igual que siempre."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:227
msgid "Status for new products"
msgstr "Estado de los productos nuevos"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:230
msgid "Status given to a product the webhook creates"
msgstr "Estado con el que se crea un producto desde el webhook"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:243
msgid ""
"A draft is not found by the B2B rules, which only ever resolve a published "
"product: a rule pointing at a draft SKU keeps failing until somebody "
"publishes it."
msgstr ""
"Un borrador no lo encuentran las reglas B2B, que solo resuelven productos "
"publicados: una regla que apunte al SKU de un borrador seguirá fallando "
"hasta que alguien lo publique."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:247
msgid "Categories and tags"
msgstr "Categorías y etiquetas"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:253
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:255
msgid "Create the categories and tags that do not exist yet"
msgstr "Crear las categorías y etiquetas que todavía no existan"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:257
msgid ""
"On by default. With it off, a product is still saved, but a category or tag "
"this store does not already have is skipped and reported in the batch log "
"instead of being created."
msgstr ""
"Viene encendido. Si se apaga, el producto se guarda igual, pero una "
"categoría o etiqueta que esta tienda no tenga se omite y se reporta en el "
"registro del envío en vez de crearse."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:261
msgid "Brands"
msgstr "Marcas"

#. translators: %s: name of the brand taxonomy currently in use, wrapped in a <code> tag.
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:268
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A product's brand is written to this store's own brands, %s. Worked out from "
"the store itself -- there is nothing to configure."
msgstr ""
"La marca de un producto se escribe en las marcas propias de esta tienda, %s. "
"Se averigua de la misma tienda: no hay nada que configurar."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:274
msgid ""
"This store has no brands of its own right now, so a brand sent in a "
"catalogue batch is skipped and reported in the batch log -- never invented."
msgstr ""
"Esta tienda no tiene marcas propias ahora mismo, así que una marca enviada "
"en un envío de catálogo se omite y se reporta en el registro del envío, "
"nunca se inventa."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:281
msgid "Retention, email and logging"
msgstr "Retención, correo y registro"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:284
msgid "Keep the received JSON and logs for"
msgstr "Conservar el JSON recibido y los registros durante"

#. translators: %d: number of months of history kept.
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:292
#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:298
#, php-format
msgid "%d month"
msgid_plural "%d months"
msgstr[0] "%d mes"
msgstr[1] "%d meses"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:299
msgid ""
"Once a day, requests and their items/events older than this are permanently "
"removed."
msgstr ""
"Una vez al día se eliminan permanentemente las peticiones y sus ítems/"
"eventos anteriores a este plazo."

#. translators: 1: date/time of the last purge, 2: number of requests removed.
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:305
#, php-format
msgid "Last automatic purge: %1$s UTC, %2$d request(s) removed."
msgstr "Última purga automática: %1$s UTC, %2$d petición(es) eliminada(s)."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:312
msgid "The automatic purge has not run yet."
msgstr "La purga automática todavía no se ha ejecutado."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:317
msgid "Welcome email"
msgstr "Correo de bienvenida"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:323
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:325
msgid ""
"Send WooCommerce's standard \"New account\" email to users created by the "
"webhook"
msgstr ""
"Enviar el correo estándar de WooCommerce «Nueva cuenta» a los usuarios "
"creados por el webhook"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:327
msgid ""
"Off by default. A single user can still request it for themselves with "
"send_welcome_email: true, regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado por defecto. Un usuario individual aún puede solicitarlo con "
"send_welcome_email: true, sin importar este ajuste."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:331
msgid "Debug events"
msgstr "Eventos de depuración"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:337
#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:339
msgid ""
"Keep debug-level events in the timeline (received, validated, queued...)"
msgstr ""
"Conservar los eventos de nivel debug en la línea de tiempo (recibido, "
"validado, encolado…)"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:341
msgid ""
"Turn this off once the integration is trusted, to keep only info/warning/"
"error events and reduce how many rows are stored."
msgstr ""
"Desactívalo una vez que la integración sea de confianza, para conservar solo "
"los eventos info/warning/error y reducir cuántas filas se almacenan."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:348
msgid ""
"One address per line, or comma-separated. Up to 10 addresses. Empty by "
"default -- no email is sent while this is empty. When set, an email is sent "
"for every rejected webhook request and every batch that finishes with errors "
"or fails, up to 30 individual emails per hour; anything beyond that is "
"combined into a single hourly digest instead of being dropped."
msgstr ""
"Una dirección por línea, o separadas por comas. Hasta 10 direcciones. Vacío "
"por defecto: no se envía ningún correo mientras esté vacío. Cuando se "
"configura, se envía un correo por cada petición del webhook rechazada y por "
"cada lote que termine con errores o falle, hasta 30 correos individuales por "
"hora; lo que exceda ese límite se agrupa en un único correo resumen por hora "
"en lugar de perderse."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:352
msgid "Email logo"
msgstr "Logo de los correos"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:358
msgid "Choose the email logo"
msgstr "Elegir el logo de los correos"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:358
msgid "Use this image"
msgstr "Usar esta imagen"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:358
msgid "Choose image"
msgstr "Elegir imagen"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:359
msgid "Remove image"
msgstr "Quitar imagen"

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:362
msgid ""
"Logo shown at the top of notification emails. Use a PNG or JPG image: most "
"email programs do not display SVG. When empty, the header image from the "
"WooCommerce email settings is used."
msgstr ""
"Logo que aparece arriba en los correos de notificación. Usa una imagen PNG o "
"JPG: la mayoría de programas de correo no muestran SVG. Si se deja vacío, se "
"usa la imagen de cabecera de los ajustes de correo de WooCommerce."

#: includes/Admin/Views/integration-settings.php:368
#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:344
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Guardar configuración"

