msgstr "Usuarios asignados"

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:160
msgid "Products &amp; prices"
msgstr "Productos y precios"

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:174
msgid ""
"These are the settings of the list itself. The products it covers, and what "
"they cost, live in the \"Products & prices\" tab."
msgstr ""
"Estos son los datos de la lista en sí. Los productos que cubre, y lo que "
"cuestan, están en la pestaña «Productos y precios»."

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:175
msgid ""
"Give the list a name and save it. Its products, prices and customers are "
"added right afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Póngale nombre a la lista y guárdela. Sus productos, precios y clientes se "
"agregan enseguida."

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:185
msgid "List details"
msgstr "Datos de la lista"

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:198
