msgstr "Déjalo vacío para generarlo automáticamente a partir del nombre"

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:199
msgid ""
"Unique identifier. Leave empty to auto-generate from the name; a numeric "
"suffix is added automatically if it is already in use."
msgstr ""
"Identificador único. Déjalo vacío para generarlo automáticamente a partir "
"del nombre; si ya está en uso se añadirá un sufijo numérico automáticamente."

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:217
msgid ""
"Only an active list changes prices. Leave it inactive while you build it: "
"nothing changes for anybody until you switch it on."
msgstr ""
"Solo una lista activa cambia precios. Déjala inactiva mientras la armas: no "
"le cambia nada a nadie hasta que la enciendas."

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:222 includes/Domain/ListService.php:126
msgid "Offer for the whole list"
msgstr "Oferta para toda la lista"

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:223
#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:239
#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:159
msgid "(optional)"
msgstr "(opcional)"

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:231
msgid ""
"Takes this percentage off every price in this list — fixed prices and "
"quantity ranges alike. Leave it empty for no offer."
msgstr ""
"Le quita este porcentaje a todos los precios de esta lista, tanto a los "
"precios fijos como a los rangos por cantidad. Déjalo vacío si no hay oferta."

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:232
msgid ""
"A rule, or a single range inside a rule, can carry its own offer: when it "
"does, that more specific percentage wins and this one does not apply to it. "
"Percentages are never added together."
msgstr ""
"Una regla, o un solo rango dentro de una regla, puede llevar su propia "
"oferta: cuando la lleva, gana ese porcentaje más específico y este no le "
"aplica. Los porcentajes nunca se suman."

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:233
msgid ""
"Example: with the list at 20%, a product priced at 50.00 is sold at 40.00 — "
"and the customer sees 50.00 struck through next to it."
msgstr ""
"Ejemplo: con la lista al 20%, un producto de 50.00 se vende a 40.00, y el "
"cliente ve el 50.00 tachado al lado."

#: includes/Admin/Views/list-form.php:244
