#: includes/Admin/Views/lists-table.php:99
msgid ""
"This plugin gives specific customers their own prices, without touching the "
"prices everybody else sees. Guests, and customers who are not on any list, "
"keep the store's normal prices exactly as before."
msgstr ""
"Este plugin le da precios propios a ciertos clientes, sin tocar los precios "
"que ve todo el mundo. Los visitantes sin sesión, y los clientes que no están "
"en ninguna lista, conservan los precios normales de la tienda tal como antes."

