msgstr "Regla guardada."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:155
msgid "1. Name this rule"
msgstr "1. Ponle nombre a esta regla"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:162
msgid "e.g. 1 L bottles"
msgstr "p. ej. Botellas de 1 L"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:164
msgid ""
"An internal label so you can tell this rule apart from the others in this "
"list. The customer never sees it: it only appears in the rules table of this "
"list and in the order record."
msgstr ""
"Una etiqueta interna para distinguir esta regla de las demás de esta lista. "
"El cliente nunca la ve: solo aparece en la tabla de reglas de esta lista y "
"en el registro del pedido."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:167
msgid ""
"It earns its keep when one product has several rules — for example a shampoo "
"with one rule for the \"1 L bottles\" and another for the \"250 ml "
"bottles\". Without a name, both rows read just \"Shampoo\" and you have to "
"open them to tell which is which. With a single rule per product you can "
"safely leave it empty."
msgstr ""
"Sirve de verdad cuando un producto tiene varias reglas; por ejemplo un "
"shampoo con una regla para las \"Botellas de 1 L\" y otra para las "
"\"Botellas de 250 ml\". Sin nombre, las dos filas dicen solo \"Shampoo\" y "
"hay que abrirlas para saber cuál es cuál. Si el producto tiene una sola "
"regla, puedes dejarlo vacío sin problema."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:175
msgid "2. Choose the product"
msgstr "2. Elige el producto"

#. translators: %s: product name, id and SKU (already formatted by ProductLookup::get_product_label(), e.g. "Blue mug (#123, SKU: MUG-BL)").
#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:193
#, php-format
msgid "Selected: %s"
msgstr "Seleccionado: %s"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:201
msgid ""
"You can type a part of the SKU: it is matched as well as the product name. "
"The SKU is shown next to every result, and next to every variation, whenever "
"the product has one."
msgstr ""
"Puedes escribir una parte del SKU: se busca igual que el nombre del "
"producto. El SKU se muestra junto a cada resultado, y junto a cada "
"variación, siempre que el producto tenga uno."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:205
msgid ""
"Changing the product re-validates the scope and clears any selected "
"variations that do not belong to the new product — price and ranges are kept."
msgstr ""
"Cambiar el producto vuelve a validar el alcance y quita las variaciones "
"marcadas que no pertenezcan al producto nuevo; el precio y los rangos se "
"conservan."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:219
msgid "The product is sold as one item, with no variations."
msgstr "El producto se vende como un solo artículo, sin variaciones."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:226
msgid "All variations (fallback rule)"
msgstr "Todas las variaciones (regla de respaldo)"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:227
msgid "The same price for every variation that no other rule covers."
msgstr "El mismo precio para cada variación que ninguna otra regla cubra."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:235
msgid "Only the variations you tick below get this price."
msgstr "Solo las variaciones que marque abajo reciben este precio."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:239
msgid ""
"A specific-variations rule and an all-variations fallback rule can coexist "
"for the same product and list."
msgstr ""
"Una regla de variaciones específicas y una regla de respaldo de todas las "
"variaciones pueden coexistir para el mismo producto y lista."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:260
msgid "3. Set the price"
msgstr "3. Pon el precio"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:273
msgid "One price, however many units they buy."
msgstr "Un solo precio, compren las unidades que compren."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:281
msgid "The unit price drops as the quantity goes up."
msgstr "El precio por unidad baja conforme sube la cantidad."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:285
msgid ""
"A fixed price is the same however many units they buy. Tiered ranges make "
"the unit price drop as the quantity goes up."
msgstr ""
"Un precio fijo es el mismo compren las unidades que compren. Los rangos "
"hacen que el precio por unidad baje conforme sube la cantidad."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:289
#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:309
msgid "Unit price"
msgstr "Precio unitario"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:298
msgid ""
"This is the final unit price the buyer pays — never a discount off the shop "
"price. Only an offer (below) changes it."
msgstr ""
"Este es el precio final por unidad que paga el comprador; nunca es un "
"descuento sobre el precio de la tienda. Lo único que lo modifica es una "
"oferta (abajo)."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:302
msgid "Price ranges"
msgstr "Rangos de precios"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:307
msgid "Min. quantity"
msgstr "Desde"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:308
msgid "Max. quantity"
msgstr "Cantidad máx."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:308
msgid "empty = open range"
msgstr "vacío = rango abierto"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:310
msgid "only this range"
msgstr "solo este rango"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:335
msgid "Add range"
msgstr "Añadir rango"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:336
msgid ""
"Ranges must not overlap or leave gaps: if one ends at 30, the next starts at "
"31. Only the last range (by minimum quantity) may be left open."
msgstr ""
"Los rangos no pueden traslaparse ni dejar huecos: si uno termina en 30, el "
"siguiente empieza en 31. Solo el último rango (por cantidad mínima) puede "
"quedar abierto."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:337
msgid ""
"The \"Offer %\" column discounts that one range only. Leave it empty and the "
"range keeps exactly the price you typed."
msgstr ""
"La columna \"Oferta %\" descuenta solo ese rango. Déjala vacía y el rango se "
"queda exactamente con el precio que escribiste."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:344
msgid "4. Offer for this rule (optional)"
msgstr "4. Oferta para esta regla (opcional)"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:348
msgid "Discount"
msgstr "Descuento"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:355
msgid ""
"Takes this percentage off the price above — off the fixed price, or off "
"every range that has no offer of its own. Leave it empty for no offer."
msgstr ""
"Le quita este porcentaje al precio de arriba: al precio fijo, o a todos los "
"rangos que no tengan una oferta propia. Déjalo vacío si no hay oferta."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:356
msgid ""
"The customer sees the price before the offer struck through, the offer price "
"in full size, and a \"-%\" badge. The final price is what goes into the cart "
"and the order."
msgstr ""
"El cliente ve el precio sin oferta tachado, el precio de oferta en grande y "
"una etiqueta \"-%\". El precio final es el que entra al carrito y al pedido."

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:359
msgid ""
"When more than one offer could apply, the most specific one wins — they are "
"never added up:"
msgstr ""
"Cuando puede aplicar más de una oferta, gana la más específica; nunca se "
"suman:"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:361
msgid "the offer on a price range"
msgstr "la oferta de un rango de precios"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:362
msgid "the offer on this rule"
msgstr "la oferta de esta regla"

#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:363
msgid "the offer on the whole list"
msgstr "la oferta de toda la lista"

#. translators: %s: offer percentage configured on the list.
#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-group-form.php:370
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This list currently carries a -%s%% offer. It applies to everything here "
"that does not define its own."
msgstr ""
"Ahora mismo esta lista lleva una oferta de -%s%%. Aplica a todo lo de aquí "
"que no defina la suya propia."

