#: includes/Admin/Views/rule-groups-table.php:111
msgid ""
"Add one rule per product: pick the product, decide whether its price is "
"fixed or by quantity ranges, and — if you want — put an offer on top."
msgstr ""
"Agrega una regla por producto: eliges el producto, decides si su precio es "
