#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:39
msgid ""
"On a variable product the table lands right after the variation selectors "
"and right before the quantity field. On a simple product, right before the "
"quantity field."
msgstr ""
"En un producto variable, la tabla queda justo después de los selectores de "
