msgstr "Antes"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:109
msgid "Sample product"
msgstr "Producto de ejemplo"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:119
msgid "How wholesale prices and the price table are shown in the shop"
msgstr ""
"Cómo se muestran en la tienda los precios mayoristas y la tabla de precios"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:134
msgid ""
"Nothing on this screen changes a price: it only decides how the wholesale "
"price and the quantity table are shown to a customer who already has a price "
"list."
msgstr ""
"Nada de esta pantalla cambia un precio: solo decide cómo se le muestran el "
"precio mayorista y la tabla de cantidades a un cliente que ya tiene lista de "
"precios."

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:143
msgid "Price layout"
msgstr "Formato del precio"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:145
msgid ""
"How the wholesale price is arranged. It changes no price and hides no data: "
"the same pieces are always shown -- what the customer pays, the price it is "
"compared against, and the minimum quantity -- only laid out differently. "
"Catalogue cards and the product page are set separately, because a narrow "
"card and a roomy product page rarely want the same arrangement."
msgstr ""
"Cómo se acomoda el precio de mayoreo. No cambia ningún precio ni esconde "
"nada: siempre se muestran los mismos datos —lo que paga el cliente, el "
"precio con el que se compara y el mínimo de unidades—, sólo que ordenados de "
"otra forma. Las tarjetas del catálogo y la ficha del producto se configuran "
"por separado, porque una tarjeta angosta y una ficha con espacio casi nunca "
"piden lo mismo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:153
msgid "On catalogue cards"
msgstr "En las tarjetas del catálogo"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:154
msgid ""
"Cards in the shop, category, brand and search pages, and the product "
"carousels."
msgstr ""
"Las tarjetas de la tienda, de las páginas de categoría, marca y búsqueda, y "
"de los carruseles de productos."

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:157
msgid "On the product page"
msgstr "En la ficha del producto"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:158
msgid ""
"The main price next to the product title, including the price that updates "
"when a variation or a quantity is chosen."
msgstr ""
"El precio principal junto al nombre del producto, incluido el que se "
"actualiza al elegir una variación o una cantidad."

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:165
msgid "One line"
msgstr "Una línea"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:166
msgid ""
"Everything on a single line, with the compared price struck through. Best "
"where there is width to spare."
msgstr ""
"Todo en una sola línea, con el precio de comparación tachado. Va bien donde "
"sobra ancho."

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:170
msgid "Two lines"
msgstr "Dos líneas"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:171
msgid ""
"The price paid on its own line, big and first, with its offer badge; "
"underneath, in small type, the minimum quantity and the compared price, "
"named instead of struck through (\"Unit\", or \"Before\" when an offer "
"applies). On catalogue cards both lines are centred. Best on narrow cards, "
"and it is what most wholesale catalogues use."
msgstr ""
"El precio que se paga en su propia línea, grande y de primero, con su "
"etiqueta de oferta; debajo, en letra pequeña, el mínimo de unidades y el "
"precio de comparación con su nombre en vez de tachado (\"Unidad\", o "
"\"Antes\" cuando hay oferta). En las tarjetas del catálogo las dos líneas "
"van centradas. Va bien en tarjetas angostas, y es lo que usa la mayoría de "
"catálogos de mayoreo."

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:198
msgid "Wholesale price table"
msgstr "Tabla de precios B2B"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:201
msgid "Show table"
msgstr "Mostrar tabla"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:208
msgid ""
"Show the wholesale price table to customers with an applicable price list"
msgstr ""
"Mostrar la tabla de precios B2B a los clientes con una lista de precios "
"aplicable"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:213
msgid "Show title"
msgstr "Mostrar título"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:220
msgid "Show the table title"
msgstr "Mostrar el título de la tabla"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:229
msgid "Show column headers"
msgstr "Mostrar encabezados de columna"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:236
msgid "Show the quantity/price column headers"
msgstr "Mostrar los encabezados de las columnas de cantidad y precio"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:249
msgid "Inline variation price"
msgstr "Precio inline junto a la variación"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:256
msgid "Show B2B price next to the product/variation selection"
msgstr "Mostrar precio B2B junto a la selección del producto"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:259
msgid ""
"Controls only the struck-through regular price + B2B price + minimum "
"quantity note shown right after selecting a variation. Disabling it does not "
"affect the wholesale price table, catalog prices or the cart -- those keep "
"working normally."
msgstr ""
"Controla únicamente el precio regular tachado + precio B2B + nota de "
"cantidad mínima que aparece justo después de seleccionar una variación. "
"Desactivarlo no afecta la tabla de precios al por mayor, los precios de "
"catálogo ni el carrito -- esos siguen funcionando con normalidad."

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:280
msgid ""
"The [b2b_price_list_table] shortcode is always available regardless of this "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"El shortcode [b2b_price_list_table] está siempre disponible, sin importar "
"esta configuración."

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:287
msgid "Activity log"
msgstr "Historial de actividad"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:290
msgid "Keep history for"
msgstr "Conservar el historial"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:305
msgid ""
"Once a day, entries older than this are saved into the archive of their "
"month and only then removed from the history. Nothing is deleted without "
"being archived first, and archives are kept. Six months is the default."
msgstr ""
"Una vez al día, las entradas más antiguas que esto se guardan en el archivo "
"de su mes y solo entonces se quitan del historial. Nada se borra sin "
"archivarse antes, y los archivos se conservan. Seis meses es lo "
"predeterminado."

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:308
msgid "Open the activity log"
msgstr "Abrir el historial de actividad"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:324
msgid "Uninstallation"
msgstr "Desinstalación"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:327
msgid "Permanently delete all data on uninstall"
msgstr "Eliminar permanentemente todos los datos al desinstalar"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:334
msgid ""
"When this plugin is uninstalled, permanently delete every B2B Price Lists "
"table and setting"
msgstr ""
"Al desinstalar este plugin, eliminar permanentemente todas las tablas y la "
"configuración de Listas de precios B2B"

#: includes/Admin/Views/settings-form.php:337
msgid ""
"Disabled by default: uninstalling the plugin normally keeps every "
"list, rule and setting untouched. Enable this only if you want a future "
"uninstall to permanently erase this plugin's own data. This never deletes "
"WooCommerce products, users, orders, or any order line item data -- those "
"always belong to WooCommerce, never to this option."
msgstr ""
"Desactivado por defecto: desinstalar el plugin normalmente "
"conserva intactas todas las listas, reglas y configuraciones. Activa esta "
"opción solo si quieres que una futura desinstalación borre permanentemente "
"los datos propios de este plugin. Esto nunca elimina productos, usuarios, "
"pedidos ni datos de líneas de pedido de WooCommerce -- esos siempre "
"pertenecen a WooCommerce, nunca a esta opción."

